      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by a \"goblin's treasure trove\"? I'm just looking for the N-P-K breakdown and the chemical impact on the soil. Can you just give me the technical comparison of how blood meal vs bone meal affects nitrogen availability and pH levels?",
